msgstr "Each risk scope's figures add up its scenarios exactly as its own Aggregate risk does: the mean annual loss exposure of each scenario's latest simulation, a likelihood of 1 − e^−LEF and a loss magnitude of the exposure divided by the LEF. The change compares today with the first day of the last 12 months that has a figure. The row shows as many risk scopes as its width holds, and the last card sums up the rest."

